    <panel_attributes>+ scheduledDeparture = first scheduled departure moment 
among the legs of the flight.

+ scheduledArrival = last scheduled arrival moment 
among the legs of the flight.

+ originCity = city of the departure airport of
the first leg of the flight.

+ destinationCity = city of the arrival airport of the last leg of the flight.

+ layovers = number of layovers based on the 
intermediate stops between the first and last leg of the flight.
